  "reviewer_note": "No opened page dates the Nuʻuanu fight to a day. The pin is the Pali Lookout (OSM); landings were at Waiʻalae and Waikīkī. Casualty figures (800 over the cliffs, per GoHawaii and Huapala) are omitted. Kauaʻi stayed independent until 1810 per EBSCO, so the full unification came later.",
